<view class="page"><scene-backdrop/><view class="card handicap-panel"><view class="row"><view class="grow"><view>我的差点 · 基础参考</view><view class="muted">{{handicap.mode}}</view></view><text class="handicap-big">{{handicap.display}}</text></view><view class="note space">自动值 {{handicap.automaticDisplay}} · 合格记录 {{handicap.validCount}} 轮</view><view class="note">{{handicap.note}}</view><view class="row space"><text class="link" bindtap="manual">手动设置</text><text class="link" bindtap="automatic">使用自动值</text><text class="link" bindtap="explain">计算说明</text></view><view class="quiet-link" bindtap="ratings">补充已完赛的评级资料 ›</view></view><view wx:if="{{ratingOpen}}" class="card"><qy-picker title="选择已完赛球局" class="choice-picker choice-inset" data-title="选择已完赛球局" disabled="{{!ratingRounds.length}}" range="{{ratingRounds}}" range-key="label" value="{{ratingIndex}}" bindchange="selectRating"><view class="select-field "><view class="select-copy"><view class="select-label">评级对应球局</view><view class="select-value">{{ratingRounds[ratingIndex].label}}</view></view><image class="select-chevron" src="/assets/chevron.png" aria-hidden="true"/></view></qy-picker><view class="note space">按本轮 Tee 的记分卡或差点机构资料填写。调整总杆不是原始总杆，请核对后录入。</view><input type="digit" data-key="courseRating" value="{{rating.courseRating}}" bindinput="ratingInput" placeholder="Course Rating · 球场评级"/><input type="number" data-key="slopeRating" value="{{rating.slopeRating}}" bindinput="ratingInput" placeholder="Slope Rating · 坡度评级 55–155"/><input type="number" data-key="adjustedGross" value="{{rating.adjustedGross}}" bindinput="ratingInput" placeholder="调整总杆"/><input data-key="pcc" value="{{rating.pcc}}" bindinput="ratingInput" placeholder="PCC · -1 至 3"/><button class="primary space" bindtap="saveRating">确认资料并重算</button></view><view class="choices"><text wx:for="{{filters}}" wx:key="id" class="choice {{scope===item.id?'active':''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="filter">{{item.name}}</text></view><view class="choices space"><text class="choice" data-n="18" bindtap="size">18 洞</text><text class="choice" data-n="9" bindtap="size">9 洞</text></view><view class="muted">正式实际仅统计来源明确、正式规则且完整实际完洞的球局。旧版推杆来源未确认，不进入明确填写的推杆均值。</view>
<view class="eyebrow">YOUR GAME, IN FOCUS</view><view class="title">看见自己的进步</view><view class="sub">用数据认识每一次挥杆</view><view class="card dark space"><view class="muted">{{size}} 洞平均杆</view><view style="font-size:98rpx;font-weight:600;margin:14rpx 0">{{s.avg}}</view><view class="row"><text>最佳 {{s.best}} 杆</text><text>已完成 {{s.rounds}} 轮</text></view></view><view class="metrics"><view class="metric"><text class="num">{{s.holes}}</text><text class="label">累计球洞</text></view><view class="metric"><text class="num">{{s.putts}}</text><text class="label">平均推杆 / 洞</text></view><view class="metric"><text class="num">{{s.penalties}}</text><text class="label">累计罚杆</text></view></view><view class="section">技术表现</view><view class="card"><view class="row"><text>球道命中率 FIR</text><text style="font-size:38rpx;color:#176b48">{{s.fwRate}}</text></view><view class="divider"/><view class="row"><text>果岭命中率 GIR</text><text style="font-size:38rpx;color:#176b48">{{s.girRate}}</text></view><view class="sub space">命中率仅统计明确记录的洞；Par 3 不计球道命中率。</view></view><view class="section">最近 8 轮</view><view class="card"><view wx:if="{{s.trend.length}}" class="chart"><view class="bar-group" wx:for="{{s.trend}}" wx:key="index"><text class="small">{{item.score}}</text><view class="bar-track"><view class="bar" style="height:{{item.height}}%"/></view><view class="tiny">{{item.played}}洞</view><view class="tiny">{{item.shortDate}}</view></view></view><view wx:else class="empty">完成第一轮后，在这里看见你的成绩趋势。</view></view><view class="muted">仅统计已结束球局中“我”的成绩。平均杆与最佳杆仅采用所选洞数的完整球局；趋势展示本轮总杆与洞数，9 洞和未完整成绩不能直接比较。</view>
</view>

